      "id": "2086305001110954244",
      "text": "Grok Imagine can meme",
      "created_at": "Sun Aug 09 04:14:08 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2086240936229761515",
        "text": "Imagine Image 2.0 is god-tier for memes.\n\nMagic wand edits the region you select and leaves the rest of the frame pixel identical. Swap one face in a group photo without regenerating the whole image.\n\nBackground removal exports any subject transparent, so you get cutouts for reaction images without opening Photoshop.\n\nMulti-ref takes up to 5 images in one generation. Feed it a template plus your sources and it composites them for you.\n\nText rendering holds up too. Impact captions and fake screenshots come out readable.\n\nFull meme production pipeline in one tab.",
